      {
        "name": "find_order_evidence",
        "title": "Find evidence for an order",
        "description": "Before creating a compensation case: look up an order number in «استرداد». Returns the branch photos or videos sent to Tadqeeq's Telegram bot for that order (use the evidence id with create_compensation_case) and, for Jahez, matching compensation lines already in the platform's files.",
